{"id":"384c24ae38b35244","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-inf-logic.md","title":"Infinitary Logic","display":"df-inf-logic — Infinitary Logic","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-inf-logic","aliases":["57-df-inf-logic"],"display":"df-inf-logic — Infinitary Logic","depends_on":["[[57-df-Lomega1omega]]","[[57-df-so-formula]]","[[57-df-cardinal]]","[[57-df-first-order-language]]","[[57-df-assignment]]","[[57-df-atomic-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-inf-logic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-inf-logic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-inf-logic — Infinitary Logic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7a465cae4692d50e\" href=\"?note=7a465cae4692d50e\" title=\"57-df-Lomega1omega\">57-df-Lomega1omega</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"433037f9b53db530\" href=\"?note=433037f9b53db530\" title=\"57-df-so-formula\">57-df-so-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a7a345348b1a1d3a\" href=\"?note=a7a345348b1a1d3a\" title=\"57-df-cardinal\">57-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"140b30594fbd26d8\" href=\"?note=140b30594fbd26d8\" title=\"57-df-first-order-language\">57-df-first-order-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d5f7158a321b8947\" href=\"?note=d5f7158a321b8947\" title=\"57-df-assignment\">57-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e38e198d11ebfafa\" href=\"?note=e38e198d11ebfafa\" title=\"57-df-atomic-formula\">57-df-atomic-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\ge\\lambda\\ge\\aleph_0\">\\(\\kappa\\ge\\lambda\\ge\\aleph_0\\)</span> 为无限基数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa^+\">\\(\\kappa^+\\)</span> 是后继基数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\xi&lt;\\kappa^+\">\\(\\xi&lt;\\kappa^+\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta&lt;\\kappa^+\">\\(\\eta&lt;\\kappa^+\\)</span> 为极限序数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为本册字母表；语法采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"7a465cae4692d50e\" href=\"?note=7a465cae4692d50e\" title=\"57-df-Lomega1omega\">57-df-Lomega1omega</a> 的带标签良基树。对无穷长度的互异变量列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x:\\delta\\hookrightarrow\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(\\vec x:\\delta\\hookrightarrow\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta&lt;\\lambda\">\\(\\delta&lt;\\lambda\\)</span>，加入互不混同的块量词构造子；有限块按从右到左迭代普通一元量词，空块为恒等。原可数变量池不扩大。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Quant}\">\\(\\mathrm{Quant}\\)</span> 是以下构造操作的类。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\kappa\\lambda}\">\\(\\models_{\\kappa\\lambda}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_{\\kappa\\lambda}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_{\\kappa\\lambda}\\)</span> 的原子、否定、集合合取及集合析取条款逐字采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"7a465cae4692d50e\" href=\"?note=7a465cae4692d50e\" title=\"57-df-Lomega1omega\">57-df-Lomega1omega</a> 的对应递归等式，仅将下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\infty\">\\(\\infty\\)</span> 换为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\lambda\">\\(\\kappa\\lambda\\)</span>；本文件列出块量词的新增条款。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Q\\langle\\rangle\\theta\\coloneqq\\theta,\\qquad Q(x_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1})\\theta\\coloneqq Qx_0\\cdots Qx_{n-1}\\theta\\quad(Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\},n&lt;\\omega).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Q\\langle\\rangle\\theta\\coloneqq\\theta,\\qquad Q(x_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1})\\theta\\coloneqq Qx_0\\cdots Qx_{n-1}\\theta\\quad(Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\},n&lt;\\omega).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Quant}_{&lt;\\lambda}(F)\\coloneqq\\{Q\\vec x\\theta:Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\},\\ \\delta&lt;\\lambda,\\ \\vec x:\\delta\\hookrightarrow\\mathrm{Var},\\ \\theta\\in F\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Quant}_{&lt;\\lambda}(F)\\coloneqq\\{Q\\vec x\\theta:Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\},\\ \\delta&lt;\\lambda,\\ \\vec x:\\delta\\hookrightarrow\\mathrm{Var},\\ \\theta\\in F\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nG_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{AtFml}_S,\\\\\nG_{\\xi+1}&amp;\\coloneqq G_\\xi\\cup\\{\\neg\\theta:\\theta\\in G_\\xi\\}\\cup\\{\\bigwedge\\Psi,\\bigvee\\Psi:\\Psi\\subseteq G_\\xi,\\ |\\Psi|&lt;\\kappa\\}\\cup\\mathrm{Quant}_{&lt;\\lambda}(G_\\xi),\\\\\nG_\\eta&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\xi&lt;\\eta}G_\\xi,\\qquad L_{\\kappa\\lambda}(S)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\xi&lt;\\kappa^+}G_\\xi,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Quant}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\theta\\mapsto Q\\vec x\\theta):Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\},\\ \\delta&lt;\\lambda,\\ \\vec x:\\delta\\hookrightarrow\\mathrm{Var}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nG_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{AtFml}_S,\\\\\nG_{\\xi+1}&amp;\\coloneqq G_\\xi\\cup\\{\\neg\\theta:\\theta\\in G_\\xi\\}\\cup\\{\\bigwedge\\Psi,\\bigvee\\Psi:\\Psi\\subseteq G_\\xi,\\ |\\Psi|&lt;\\kappa\\}\\cup\\mathrm{Quant}_{&lt;\\lambda}(G_\\xi),\\\\\nG_\\eta&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\xi&lt;\\eta}G_\\xi,\\qquad L_{\\kappa\\lambda}(S)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\xi&lt;\\kappa^+}G_\\xi,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Quant}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\theta\\mapsto Q\\vec x\\theta):Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\},\\ \\delta&lt;\\lambda,\\ \\vec x:\\delta\\hookrightarrow\\mathrm{Var}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\beta[\\vec a/\\vec x](y)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}a_i,&amp;y=x_i\\ (i&lt;\\delta),\\\\\\beta(y),&amp;y\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x),\\end{cases}\\quad(\\vec a\\in|\\mathfrak A|^\\delta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\beta[\\vec a/\\vec x](y)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}a_i,&amp;y=x_i\\ (i&lt;\\delta),\\\\\\beta(y),&amp;y\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x),\\end{cases}\\quad(\\vec a\\in|\\mathfrak A|^\\delta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathfrak A,\\beta\\models_{\\kappa\\lambda}\\forall\\vec x\\theta&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\vec a\\in|\\mathfrak A|^\\delta\\;(\\mathfrak A,\\beta[\\vec a/\\vec x]\\models_{\\kappa\\lambda}\\theta),\\\\\n\\mathfrak A,\\beta\\models_{\\kappa\\lambda}\\exists\\vec x\\theta&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\vec a\\in|\\mathfrak A|^\\delta\\;(\\mathfrak A,\\beta[\\vec a/\\vec x]\\models_{\\kappa\\lambda}\\theta),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_{\\kappa\\lambda}(Q\\vec x\\theta)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_{\\kappa\\lambda}(\\theta)\\setminus\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathfrak A,\\beta\\models_{\\kappa\\lambda}\\forall\\vec x\\theta&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\vec a\\in|\\mathfrak A|^\\delta\\;(\\mathfrak A,\\beta[\\vec a/\\vec x]\\models_{\\kappa\\lambda}\\theta),\\\\\n\\mathfrak A,\\beta\\models_{\\kappa\\lambda}\\exists\\vec x\\theta&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\vec a\\in|\\mathfrak A|^\\delta\\;(\\mathfrak A,\\beta[\\vec a/\\vec x]\\models_{\\kappa\\lambda}\\theta),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_{\\kappa\\lambda}(Q\\vec x\\theta)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_{\\kappa\\lambda}(\\theta)\\setminus\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原 Fml(S,&lt;κ-连接/&lt;λ-Quant) 没有被定义；现改为集合递归。原子、否定、合取与析取的语义及 FV 递归沿用 Lω₁ω 文件的同构造子条款。有限块不新造与迭代量词不一致的语法对象。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-Lomega1omega","status":"resolved","id":"7a465cae4692d50e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-Lomega1omega]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-so-formula","status":"resolved","id":"433037f9b53db530","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-so-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"a7a345348b1a1d3a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"140b30594fbd26d8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"d5f7158a321b8947","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-atomic-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e38e198d11ebfafa","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-atomic-formula